#: badend3:badend3_C70F299F_DA84_4B00_9E9E_EDA04274BA9A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eaa27fc22cd75358aba373b6143b9b8c9436f01feccdf49d32e77df35ccad9e4
#. default-sha256: e67f8e0c535c7ad776425cfe8b53cd3153bb491b5707d193d1cc34a4b37a923c
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_C70F299F_DA84_4B00_9E9E_EDA04274BA9A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫I "
"can’t force her to do something she doesn’t want to."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫……지젤에게 "
"강요하지는 ⟪k:16⟫못 하겠다……."

#: badend3:badend3_74F825C4_270A_4F90_9221_8B5CA412E57C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ed0ef4dfd3dc3380a92fb192b57a0738ca7ab23f8dce7b0dcb85ba9aa85bf54
#. default-sha256: c563b3d78bab9411be7a9e7ca5788613e5cec5acf5cf9dc1cf4c5bd3bda5239e
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_74F825C4_270A_4F90_9221_8B5CA412E57C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If she doesn’t reclaim herself on her own... ⟪k:1⟫I’ll never get to hear her say my name "
"again..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫지젤이 자기 자신을 되찾지 않는 한……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫지젤은 영원히 ⟪k:3⟫내 이름을 부르지 않으리라……."

#: badend3:badend3_547360EE_32D4_4534_8ED5_5D740F96586D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75f6810a7fb91500197f6c99afe189975e441985f1644a407bdb5b804d922791
#. default-sha256: a941879d2022f264edec6bad076563cdb2a1185450eb3437d769491c22ef4695
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_547360EE_32D4_4534_8ED5_5D740F96586D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But if she wants to leave all that behind her... ⟪k:1⟫then it’s not my place to interfere."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 그것마저 ⟪k:1⟫버리고 싶은 과거라면……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내가 뭐라 할 자격은 없다……."

#: badend3:badend3_547360EE_32D4_4534_8ED5_5D740F96686D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bdab02f0d81559b5047ce6d2ad9d737d0f5ea98b9ac5f262efbbfbf8d236bd40
#. default-sha256: 26ef02885ffcebac85627c267a86c1f32d54a112ee7dc1340126452f16a005b3
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_547360EE_32D4_4534_8ED5_5D740F96686D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ve done things that would warrant her wanting to rewrite her past, erasing me entirely."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지젤이 과거를 바꾸어 ⟪k:1⟫내 존재를 지우려 할 만큼의 잘못을―― 내가 저지른 것일 테니."

#: badend3:badend3_14501C98_A043_4232_9EFD_BCFC5DCC400A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 058e64949b033a3e1e21bb8b431a6a22a2139b061cac6a50c0ceefa3585762ba
#. default-sha256: ed4f7228cdc33589a31885cced1983c5c3a6844ebb3f57ad92bd01e757c8b07c
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_14501C98_A043_4232_9EFD_BCFC5DCC400A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I think, more than anything..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는―― ⟪k:1⟫그 ⟪k:2⟫무엇보다도……"

#: badend3:badend3_71304866_D2C8_406C_A8AF_B269483EF474
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b588d1589a902b4d159a387756611eb7441e7f232774c2fb8d075a3eb9356c04
#. default-sha256: 893ab9ed4043645b6385c7bd9424151c5a6fc1363e91ba14d697c9949b432162
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_71304866_D2C8_406C_A8AF_B269483EF474"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m afraid of hurting her, of breaking her any more than she already is."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지젤을 더 상처 입혀서 ⟪k:1⟫무너트리는 걸 ⟪k:2⟫두려워하고 있다……."

#: badend3:badend3_202FBE8C_5025_42D3_AB14_844F51FDD442
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8185f272000c8a795d6a07e6916594f441c2fdc594a9716592d42ab9d5991cff
#. default-sha256: e92e89fc8abbb93b74f333accd7bf72fb3016c97225ae006876a944f6a3e9411
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_202FBE8C_5025_42D3_AB14_844F51FDD442"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………."

#: badend3:badend3_63F96811_C8E8_4907_87B9_416FA37B0D60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14703069132cef8ccf492ce6be105ac29b8de4c5aa879a00edee2bcc2104e0bb
#. default-sha256: 05e92a87f4c5b39e9a914ba4b6e5c5286c1f2bbd757de2dcd681f1f391e0701b
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_63F96811_C8E8_4907_87B9_416FA37B0D60"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, mine is a more cowardly fear.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m just afraid she’ll no longer take my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아니, ⟪k:1⟫그게 아니다……. 더 소심한 공포다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫지젤이 ⟪k:4⟫내 손을 잡아 주지 않을 가능"
"성이…… 두려운 것이다."

#: badend3:badend3_9B32C9AE_4431_40EB_8BDD_4E5E2BDCC447
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9fc81397f385f9765d6bc9bf88d22a75054e062d744d6168af4bea2f15ef045
#. default-sha256: 7d4f52529cb8edc00d2ab08aa5d65e9864d10df8814eb898336888a5d04bec29
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_9B32C9AE_4431_40EB_8BDD_4E5E2BDCC447"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right... ⟪k:2⟫then..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫알겠……⟪k:2⟫습니다……."

#: badend3:badend3_F984F247_AA15_40B3_9095_233FAF5E052E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 202756daa0974d5a58abf2a0d195a4753e205ff9702be9eae204aa5f893277c6
#. default-sha256: db81e72f59b7aea8bdc3be6dfaec9cc08b03c966ada0880d2df0e373ecc433cb
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_F984F247_AA15_40B3_9095_233FAF5E052E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What should have been behind the door... ⟪k:1⟫was our life together."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫문 안에 있어야 하던 것은 ⟪k:1⟫원래……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫나와 지젤의 생활이었으리라."

#: badend3:badend3_F35D6B1C_3494_447D_A012_22EF8C656B19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea06130077aa37caee8a7f395d3a2c7814a29650fdbdaabf98d8d1c619a69d8c
#. default-sha256: 08ba513b3559730c34321df600f5337cb6889c955eb3c28f5e99dc511eeaa651
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_F35D6B1C_3494_447D_A012_22EF8C656B19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But for her, there’s nothing but misery there anymore.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In our time together, and in "
"me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 그건…… ⟪k:1⟫지젤에게는 이미 ⟪k:2⟫고통스러운 기억에 불과하다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫내 존재 자체마저"
"도."

#: badend3:badend3_B135271A_95CE_45F0_A7ED_3B803136CB56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2088d68a4d7a7d6535d34be6b3b5dcb4d20d665b28b4707f76f7a44980f5d1fc
#. default-sha256: 2e0302fa98de9e3cdd482f6d9ff2d524e761d0f17e4b0062882cb54809943c28
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_B135271A_95CE_45F0_A7ED_3B803136CB56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Forget everything I’ve said.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The tale within the fourth door was the whole truth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……제 말은 잊어 주십시오.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그대가 보여 준 문 너머가…… ⟪k:3⟫모든 것의 진실입니다."

#: badend3:badend3_A6302219_4360_40D0_9A8C_5619F188455C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f5f6aa80e4f12aa2e32d98b833072b7b40e7d31e60aeeeb47ee4939655d96eb
#. default-sha256: 3b56e9776a65196ec60be88a790f21d0163807936f47e4b77b58d515c9a405d5
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_A6302219_4360_40D0_9A8C_5619F188455C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I can live with that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그렇게 칩시다……."

#: badend3:badend3_FAF57415_6FEA_4EBA_83E5_5340DBE4ADA7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ec09dbaf74805a07da6f8f158c68f8e73fb6af9908137962287c08ae257de29
#. default-sha256: c554a8811ce89b45d3b90cb2026b770098d810f46ea9fc417fe6c48cb037491b
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_FAF57415_6FEA_4EBA_83E5_5340DBE4ADA7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫....................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………………."

#: badend3:badend3_F205E639_DF0B_4F13_BC4F_A7D8A77FE9A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 611900182b2e6fd2c5e1c2e6b058bed9b2a389cb743794cfd36cbace53c65cdd
#. default-sha256: be9bbd1f079bc8fa5871585b558ebc251e85eb779a5258ff3e80a787e0ebc910
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_F205E639_DF0B_4F13_BC4F_A7D8A77FE9A0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I would just ask you to allow me one thing...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫To remain by your side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그래도 단 하나만 ⟪k:3⟫부탁하고 싶습니다…….⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫저를…… ⟪k:6⟫그대 곁에 있게 해 "
"주십시오……."

#: badend3:badend3_1CBBB369_2794_43B9_9D76_29CBF71151CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f77db33f5f4a4b89d1cda5ae2274be983505cbb8d151c94d6a5cb85c94b749cb
#. default-sha256: 9f5d8b75a426ce7e0b2defa36398108b8f66f0c7cada22d3240c98f2ec96b662
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_1CBBB369_2794_43B9_9D76_29CBF71151CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……그거야……."

#: badend3:badend3_7617E012_B4C3_4E0E_9BDF_9A7BF2BC9F7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30951b896b4b2203020b721a4de78d22d5dc2e0f0c14287d67867921970e858e
#. default-sha256: 18042c8b1cac7dbd061135873d632c7322eabe31f813bbfb4d56f907c4586207
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_7617E012_B4C3_4E0E_9BDF_9A7BF2BC9F7F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Of course you may."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫물론 ⟪k:2⟫당연히 그래야지요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫제가 ⟪k:5⟫말씀드리지 않았는지요."

#: badend3:badend3_B66E0276_AEE5_48AA_84C5_BBE775A309AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70924e9eecda32ce127067d698ccfe74f6e0d2eee9b2b27f47c36a96193f4671
#. default-sha256: c9a0d1551e47f97d01bdbb5e892aa783996d09d782b4fe3a677b77c2ce819670
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_B66E0276_AEE5_48AA_84C5_BBE775A309AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was the one who asked you...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫to forget about everything and live in eternal "
"darkness with me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫이 영원한 어둠 속에서 ⟪k:2⟫모든 걸 잊고……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫저와 함께 살아가자고요."

#: badend3:badend3_889CF03A_8988_4A6B_9154_05B232166190
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b667e93ba638d6bae49a788b4f20228272dd537894cfb4015636dddfe397841
#. default-sha256: 82f2ef13fe7ce8a0956cc074d040fd805e1b4f38988a9d01d11fb06bddad7bce
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_889CF03A_8988_4A6B_9154_05B232166190"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe... ⟪k:2⟫what a silly question.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Did you think I would ever say no?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫후후…… ⟪k:2⟫이상하신 분. ⟪k:3⟫제가 거절할 리가 없는데 말이지요."

#: badend3:badend3_CD69DE7F_D1E0_4D28_A5A9_DD42EFFE124E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8185f272000c8a795d6a07e6916594f441c2fdc594a9716592d42ab9d5991cff
#. default-sha256: e92e89fc8abbb93b74f333accd7bf72fb3016c97225ae006876a944f6a3e9411
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_CD69DE7F_D1E0_4D28_A5A9_DD42EFFE124E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………."

#: badend3:badend3_58A47977_610A_406A_A124_07F807C0BEC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c9a3c92b12bf40d86f41de33810db3fb73b3edde420118a27e6e93d43788c77
#. default-sha256: e7f210c5197b2e5e209d0dc6fc8dce3eca2c5b538ac35b02f1e3235b98b3b935
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_58A47977_610A_406A_A124_07F807C0BEC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Right...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You did, didn’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네……. ⟪k:1⟫……그랬죠……."

#: badend3:badend3_BCB801E7_1364_4128_8DD0_6657F4D6B165
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a8069fa74bd8c333fcc5b90819184e16834d70f5af191c84f7535a3a6f4b2c7
#. default-sha256: d75789cc614f76f5a1abf957170fe019c3ed6a82dab5dfdd21e14742421d9f42
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_BCB801E7_1364_4128_8DD0_6657F4D6B165"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Yes, I did. ⟪k:2⟫Worry not, I will banish the memory.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I am sure you were "
"simply disoriented at having learned who you are."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫네, ⟪k:2⟫그랬답니다. ⟪k:3⟫괜찮아요, ⟪k:4⟫당신의 말씀은 잊기로 하겠습니다.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫자기 "
"자신을 되찾은 게 ⟪k:7⟫혼란스러워서 그러셨겠지요."

#: badend3:badend3_A1187E10_34D3_4C5E_8103_EA7C68FA9C4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9af395de8d0d754d6e17d24290869a2d625ad319085216b4c249d20e34ec66d4
#. default-sha256: 816fd052857e5f0f9bedc5e4d20a9bd44c43a2f54fa6a47786b28241bdb97298
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_A1187E10_34D3_4C5E_8103_EA7C68FA9C4A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There is nothing to fear.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Only happiness awaits you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그래도 ⟪k:2⟫이제 괜찮답니다. ⟪k:3⟫무서운 건 ⟪k:4⟫아무것도 없습니다.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫예, ⟪k:7⟫앞"
"으로는 행복만이 기다리거든요."

#: badend3:badend3_3F28DBBC_B943_4C4C_B38C_3B9F909A66AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8185f272000c8a795d6a07e6916594f441c2fdc594a9716592d42ab9d5991cff
#. default-sha256: e92e89fc8abbb93b74f333accd7bf72fb3016c97225ae006876a944f6a3e9411
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_3F28DBBC_B943_4C4C_B38C_3B9F909A66AC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………."

#: badend3:badend3_5E64EA09_117B_4525_A7F3_166A536C201C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb057b32e7da740916e17e9ffc25543907bd87d9dc48e2e4eda31f75881588d6
