#. default-sha256: cae44e651b384b45bfdce1373005ee12306e06d98842f131f41e05e6b626fcfa
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_39F70013_B90D_43A9_9BBC_F71200BD9656"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Have I... ⟪k:1⟫ever praised her tea before?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내가…… 지젤의 허브티를 칭찬한 적이 ⟪k:1⟫있었을까?"

#: badend3:badend3_80BC73CD_7FC7_4634_ACE1_69243623D192
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ce06c8bb8ad4304eec944cf54e29622e9bce916135ec8361bf95998c8af5bd4
#. default-sha256: cc0796b2e04270eaa061970cfb7a2ace92c9ca570fccb4480e48b57761fefd22
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_80BC73CD_7FC7_4634_ACE1_69243623D192"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I do recall telling her, when I saw her gathering strange weeds from the garden for her "
"“herbal tea,”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫정원에서 자라던 뭔지 모를 식물을 모아다 ⟪k:1⟫차를 내오려 한 지젤에게―― 나는 이런 말을 한 걸"
"로 기억한다."

#: badend3:badend3_E5A02D3B_3697_4F31_AAA3_5CE1EC4CA49A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95eaf6985d896feae175d30dc07daed2b93f5e1b402c7dbc6b2e995b4f8c2150
#. default-sha256: 9586ba33ef58ba8824a73542622b6b6cfc18311fb26e674b6c5c742099c5c7c1
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_E5A02D3B_3697_4F31_AAA3_5CE1EC4CA49A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫that doing so at this house, given its reputation, only made her look like a real witch."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「안 그래도 그런 전승이 있는데, ⟪k:1⟫약초를 모으기라도 하면 진짜 마녀 같겠습니다」"

#: badend3:badend3_AB8ECA21_4C86_464A_918E_A1299B1E25CB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51df8e7d65b2fb8d209d7dee2309717114fb393160e644844445ee0b97cada7b
#. default-sha256: b98433c5cec8f93dbe42602c9f5ab672672f960699e2073df76a16e86c5de9e9
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_AB8ECA21_4C86_464A_918E_A1299B1E25CB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And how did she react to that?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I think she puffed her cheeks and frowned, and "
"then..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 후에…… ⟪k:1⟫지젤은 뭐라 했지? ⟪k:2⟫아마 뾰로통해지더니, ⟪k:3⟫화를 내며……"

#: badend3:badend3_F7782A45_E5CB_4042_A1A4_32AC673D4C2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87690807a484ece8090796f95253ef38202faef893640b388fbed9def6f73742
#. default-sha256: d8a749f2a3362b6fc41225bf9da859211f509ebe1272c1b6c2853e6dcc18970f
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_F7782A45_E5CB_4042_A1A4_32AC673D4C2A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...I can’t remember."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………더는 ⟪k:1⟫안 떠오른다."

#: badend3:badend3_76C25893_D9E0_4442_8A32_70B6F7F55630
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92e561022a06211dbe5e68c8b10cd059fa27b5fa512167864e626b695650dfda
#. default-sha256: 030ef304cfa87c7bf96a1f3d389a4ecc7d914be353dfce0048a5684aac0d2607
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_76C25893_D9E0_4442_8A32_70B6F7F55630"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She thinks I’m the White-Haired Girl, yet she calls me “Master,”⟪k:1⟫completely oblivious to "
"how absurd that sounds."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫지젤은 ⟪k:1⟫나를 “주인님”이라 부르면서도―― 나를 백발 소녀로 여기고 있다. ⟪k:2⟫그 말의 모순을 "
"깨닫지도 못 한 채로."

#: badend3:badend3_04CA0963_58FC_4FFE_AD57_D1DD77712DF6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9985f02134ee5b0ba0b34cb529b0f99235ea70852c59f1cfd818f2956b73eb5a
#. default-sha256: 09b43a29c666113058f1fbd232c7b45bb35ad85d62e6d1950972ce9a80aaf481
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_04CA0963_58FC_4FFE_AD57_D1DD77712DF6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But she won’t say my name."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……지젤은 내 이름을 부르지 않는다."

#: badend3:badend3_99892610_1DF8_4619_982C_10B67EF1C9FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15c40fe61e8bfd328a4a8828fa581a44b57dda80fc8c18178b235bd13fa07ae0
#. default-sha256: dad0754b3cb2a695b734e7a57d3ae6103b9ae847be113c9a0f1391c1d751c141
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_99892610_1DF8_4619_982C_10B67EF1C9FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, I’ll probably forget it too.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My name, who I am, everything that’s "
"happened to us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나도 머지않아 ⟪k:1⟫잊는 걸까.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내 이름과 함께…… ⟪k:4⟫우리가 겪은 모든 과거를."

#: badend3:badend3_452B56E3_3F6E_4ED2_9D27_FA1CC2D8CFF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee222603dd705680921ed6c882da473fff67820842c7040c3bc05d15dd8fa63a
#. default-sha256: 961af5b262aacf8be454b13b3fd0830cafd2e94476421166356cfa50643962ff
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_452B56E3_3F6E_4ED2_9D27_FA1CC2D8CFF2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Washed away by the darkness, never to be found again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫모든 것을 드러내지 않은 채…… ⟪k:1⟫휩쓸려 가는 걸까."

#: badend3:badend3_C5E3CE9F_9933_42BA_91DE_F19EDECF056F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f36925c4c3c860798330b826b8c772bf2ecb827123caf6d8665d363b78c04804
#. default-sha256: 84e6d88967dff4024b4fc43661b905cdfc614b728cfd424a0310909cad3a13f0
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_C5E3CE9F_9933_42BA_91DE_F19EDECF056F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She’s smiling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……지젤이 미소 짓고 있다."

#: badend3:badend3_65601CDE_EAE1_49B2_9B8D_80FA78FE4368
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7a2743042a4c8b3ac823e9e63d61b3ff7ce1fb2d27b929cea0efd981e7bd3ad
#. default-sha256: ca0231aa215118f7c30ca8411dfd97b9c4124dbfb35c48fb3a6c2e7c904b1124
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_65601CDE_EAE1_49B2_9B8D_80FA78FE4368"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I know it’s not real, but I honestly don’t care anymore."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 미소가 공허한 것임을 알아도, ⟪k:1⟫나는 더 이상 ⟪k:2⟫아무 말도 못 했다……."

#: badend3:badend3_68B941A9_D052_4BD6_8545_CA43B59D7AF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e948b0cfe4c2fb03276fe44fd81a9cbc3dd55a05ec78a6642b091d7103b7b4f6
#. default-sha256: 6466d2bd832b939a927236e443708557b603859f649be892d44f63a98761d728
msgctxt "badend3:badend3_68B941A9_D052_4BD6_8545_CA43B59D7AF3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All that matters is that she’s smiling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지젤이 어떤 형태로든 웃는다면 ⟪k:1⟫그래도 된다……."
